    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Form Intake - AI Triage\n\nWebhook receives the form POST, validates required fields, asks an LLM to classify urgency + write a summary and a reply draft, then routes the record to Sheets, Slack and an acknowledgement email.\n\n**Error branch (bottom row):** Error Trigger -> 30s backoff -> retry the call -> alert #alerts. Credentials are stored in n8n, never in the workflow.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
